.TH "ARC-EXTRACT" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-extract \- extract an archive safely
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc extract ARCHIVE [MEMBER...] [OPTIONS]
.PP
arcx ...
.PP
arc\-extract ...
.PP
arcunpack ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Safely extract selected archive members or a compressed stream. Arc indexes archive members first and enforces normalized traversal, link\-parent, conflict, and filtering rules.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-o, \-\-output DIR
.PP
\-\-destination\-policy fail|replace|rename|skip\-identical
.PP
\-\-overwrite | \-\-skip\-existing | \-\-rename\-existing
.PP
\-\-stdout
.PP
\-\-unsafe\-paths
.PP
\-\-include/\-\-exclude and rule files
.PP
\-\-password/\-\-password\-file/\-\-password\-env
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arcx backup.zip \-o restored/
.PP
arc extract backup.7z docs/readme.txt \-\-stdout
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc(1), arc\-formats(7), arc\-backends(7), arc\-remote(7)
